:R-HSA-1368071  a           owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008150 ;
        rdfs:comment        "REV-ERBA binds DNA elements very similar to those bound by the transcription activator RORA. RORAREV-ERBA bound to DNA and heme recruits the corepressors NCoR and HDAC3 to repress transcription. Thus REV-ERBA and RORA appear to compete to repress or activate genes, repectively." ;
        rdfs:label          "NR1D1 (REV-ERBA) represses gene expression" ;
        dc:contributor      "Edited: May, B, 2011-06-22" , "Authored: May, B, 2011-06-22" , "GOC:reactome_curators" , "Reviewed: Delaunay, F, 2012-01-28" ;
